  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Beadles, dragging in Hostess Quickly and Doll Tearsheet."
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hostess",
        "name": "HOSTESS",
        "displayName": "Hostess"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "No, thou arrant knave. I would to God that I might die, that I might have thee hanged. Thou hast drawn my shoulder out of joint.",
          "plainText": "No thou arrant knave I would to God that I might die that I might have thee hanged Thou hast drawn my shoulder out of joint",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-beadle",
        "name": "FIRST BEADLE",
        "displayName": "First Beadle"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "The constables have delivered her over to me, and she shall have whipping-cheer enough, I warrant her. There hath been a man or two lately killed about her.",
          "plainText": "The constables have delivered her over to me and she shall have whippingcheer enough I warrant her There hath been a man or two lately killed about her",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "doll",
        "name": "DOLL",
        "displayName": "Doll"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Nut-hook, nut-hook, you lie! Come on, I'll tell thee what, thou damned tripe-visaged rascal, an the child I now go with do miscarry, thou wert better thou hadst struck thy mother, thou paper-faced villain.",
          "plainText": "Nuthook nuthook you lie Come on I'll tell thee what thou damned tripevisaged rascal an the child I now go with do miscarry thou wert better thou hadst struck thy mother thou paperfaced villain",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-004",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hostess",
        "name": "HOSTESS",
        "displayName": "Hostess"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "O the Lord, that Sir John were come! He would make this a bloody day to somebody. But I pray God the fruit of her womb miscarry!",
          "plainText": "O the Lord that Sir John were come He would make this a bloody day to somebody But I pray God the fruit of her womb miscarry",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-005",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-beadle",
        "name": "FIRST BEADLE",
        "displayName": "First Beadle"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "If it do, you shall have a dozen of cushions again; you have but eleven now. Come, I charge you both go with me, for the man is dead that you and Pistol beat amongst you.",
          "plainText": "If it do you shall have a dozen of cushions again you have but eleven now Come I charge you both go with me for the man is dead that you and Pistol beat amongst you",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-006",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "doll",
        "name": "DOLL",
        "displayName": "Doll"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I'll tell you what, you thin man in a censer, I will have you as soundly swinged for this, you bluebottle rogue, you filthy famished correctioner, if you be not swinged, I'll forswear half-kirtles.",
          "plainText": "I'll tell you what you thin man in a censer I will have you as soundly swinged for this you bluebottle rogue you filthy famished correctioner if you be not swinged I'll forswear halfkirtles",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-007",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-beadle",
        "name": "FIRST BEADLE",
        "displayName": "First Beadle"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Come, come, you she knight-errant, come.",
          "plainText": "Come come you she knighterrant come",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-008",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hostess",
        "name": "HOSTESS",
        "displayName": "Hostess"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "O God, that right should thus overcome might! Well, of sufferance comes ease.",
          "plainText": "O God that right should thus overcome might Well of sufferance comes ease",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-009",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "doll",
        "name": "DOLL",
        "displayName": "Doll"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Come, you rogue, come, bring me to a justice.",
          "plainText": "Come you rogue come bring me to a justice",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-010",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hostess",
        "name": "HOSTESS",
        "displayName": "Hostess"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Ay, come, you starved bloodhound.",
          "plainText": "Ay come you starved bloodhound",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-011",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "doll",
        "name": "DOLL",
        "displayName": "Doll"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Goodman death, goodman bones!",
          "plainText": "Goodman death goodman bones",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-012",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "hostess",
        "name": "HOSTESS",
        "displayName": "Hostess"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Thou atomy, thou!",
          "plainText": "Thou atomy thou",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-013",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "doll",
        "name": "DOLL",
        "displayName": "Doll"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Come, you thin thing, come, you rascal!",
          "plainText": "Come you thin thing come you rascal",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-speech-014",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-beadle",
        "name": "FIRST BEADLE",
        "displayName": "First Beadle"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Very well.",
          "plainText": "Very well",
          "lineType": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth-5-4-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exeunt.]"
    }
  ]
}